# ------------------------------------------------------- Source photos ------
# ~48MB of original camera files (HEIC/JPG) and full-resolution sources that
# site assets get cropped from — including family photos of Cory's father.
#
# Deliberately NOT committed. This repo is PUBLIC, and git history is
# permanent: adding them later is easy, removing them later is not.
#
# These are irreplaceable and the repo is NOT their backup. They should live
# somewhere with real backup (iCloud, Time Machine, an external drive).
/Images/

